{"name":"算法学习","slug":"算法学习","count":1,"postlist":[{"title":"LeetCode 两数之和","slug":"My-New-Post","date":"2026-05-01T12:56:30.000Z","updated":"2026-05-31T07:51:23.620Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/My-New-Post.json","excerpt":"","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"一、题目描述\"><a href=\"#一、题目描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、题目描述\"></a>一、题目描述</h2><p><strong>LeetCode 第1题：两数之和</strong><br>给定一个整数数组 <code>nums</code> 和一个整数目标值 <code>target</code>，请你在该数组中找出和为目标值 <code>target</code> 的那两个整数，并返回它们的数组下标。</p>\n<p>示例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[0,1]</code></li>\n<li>解释：因为 <code>nums[0] + nums[1] == 9</code>，返回 <code>[0, 1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"二、解题思路分析\"><a href=\"#二、解题思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、解题思路分析\"></a>二、解题思路分析</h2><h3 id=\"1-暴力解法（时间复杂度O-n²-）\"><a href=\"#1-暴力解法（时间复杂度O-n²-）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 暴力解法（时间复杂度O(n²)）\"></a>1. 暴力解法（时间复杂度O(n²)）</h3><ul>\n<li>两层循环遍历数组，两两相加判断是否等于目标值</li>\n<li>缺点：时间复杂度高，大数据量下会超时</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-哈希表优化解法（时间复杂度O-n-）\"><a href=\"#2-哈希表优化解法（时间复杂度O-n-）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 哈希表优化解法（时间复杂度O(n)）\"></a>2. 哈希表优化解法（时间复杂度O(n)）</h3><ul>\n<li>核心思想：用哈希表存储已遍历的数字和下标，每次遍历时直接查找 <code>target - 当前数字</code> 是否存在</li>\n<li>优点：空间换时间，将查找操作从O(n)降为O(1)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三、代码实现（C-版本）\"><a href=\"#三、代码实现（C-版本）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、代码实现（C++版本）\"></a>三、代码实现（C++版本）</h2><figure class=\"highlight cpp\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"string\">&lt;vector&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"string\">&lt;unordered_map&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">using</span> <span class=\"keyword\">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Solution</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"function\">vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt; <span class=\"title\">twoSum</span><span class=\"params\">(vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt;&amp; nums, <span class=\"type\">int</span> target)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        unordered_map&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>, <span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt; hash; <span class=\"comment\">// key: 数字, value: 下标</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"type\">int</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; nums.<span class=\"built_in\">size</span>(); ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"type\">int</span> complement = target - nums[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (hash.<span class=\"built_in\">find</span>(complement) != hash.<span class=\"built_in\">end</span>()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;hash[complement], i&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            hash[nums[i]] = i;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;&#125;; <span class=\"comment\">// 题目保证有解，此处仅为语法补全</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"四、关键知识点与易错点\"><a href=\"#四、关键知识点与易错点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、关键知识点与易错点\"></a>四、关键知识点与易错点</h2><p>哈希表的选择：unordered_map 底层是哈希表，平均查找时间 O (1)；map 底层是红黑树，查找时间 O (logn)，优先使用 unordered_map。<br>题目隐含条件：数组中同一个元素不能使用两遍，因此要先查找再存入哈希表，避免自身匹配。<br>边界情况处理：<br>数组长度为 2 时的特殊情况<br>存在重复数字的场景（如 nums = [3,3], target = 6）</p>\n<h2 id=\"五、复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#五、复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"五、复杂度分析\"></a>五、复杂度分析</h2><p>时间复杂度：O (n)，n 为数组长度，只需遍历一次数组<br>空间复杂度：O (n)，最坏情况下需要存储所有元素到哈希表</p>\n<h2 id=\"六、同类题目拓展\"><a href=\"#六、同类题目拓展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"六、同类题目拓展\"></a>六、同类题目拓展</h2><p>三数之和：排序 + 双指针，避免暴力三重循环<br>四数之和：在三数之和的基础上增加一层循环，同样用双指针优化<br>两数之和 II（有序数组）：直接用双指针首尾相向遍历，无需哈希表</p>\n<h2 id=\"七、刷题心得\"><a href=\"#七、刷题心得\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"七、刷题心得\"></a>七、刷题心得</h2><p>两数之和是算法入门的经典题目，核心是学会用哈希表优化查找操作。通过这道题，掌握了空间换时间的思想，后续会继续练习双指针、滑动窗口等高频算法技巧。给我将这些写进文章</p>\n","text":"一、题目描述LeetCode 第1题：两数之和<br>给定一个整数数组 nums 和一个整数目标值 target，请你在该数组中找出和为目标值 target 的那两个整数，并返回它们的数组下标。示例：输入：nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9输出：[0,1","link":"","raw":null,"photos":[],"categories":[{"name":"算法学习","slug":"算法学习","count":1,"path":"api/categories/算法学习.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LeetCode","slug":"LeetCode","count":1,"path":"api/tags/LeetCode.json"},{"name":"哈希表","slug":"哈希表","count":1,"path":"api/tags/哈希表.json"},{"name":"刷题总结","slug":"刷题总结","count":1,"path":"api/tags/刷题总结.json"}]}]}